{"id":"n16121-2-8","stage":2,"title":"면접 · 面试","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16121-2-8-1","ko":"이 회사에서는 영어로 면접을 본대.","zh":"这家公司要用英语进行面试呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에서는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에서는","audio":"/audio/ed99fcfcd3707b371b21.mp3"}},{"text":"영어로","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영어로","audio":"/audio/acf59c2f9c2d10efa30e.mp3"}},{"text":"면접을","meaning":"面试","explanation":"면접：面试；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"면접","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16121","senseId":"2","lemma":"면접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"면접을","audio":"/audio/15938da1c1dde93acae6.mp3"}},{"text":"본대.","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본대","audio":"/audio/886782aa3deff083f47b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"61f79720989225b6","term":"면접","zh":"面试","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3","entryId":"16121","definition":"主要在笔试后进行，以跟应试者见面的形式来考察对方的人品、言行的考试。","pronunciation":["면ː접"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/397a4e9711d571844aba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16121-2-8-2","ko":"어떡하지? 나는 영어에 자신이 없는데.","zh":"怎么办？我对英语可没自信啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떡하지?","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떡하지","audio":"/audio/22bed8a36bdcb0058c61.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"영어에","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영어에","audio":"/audio/9c279b3c43bbeb162f97.mp3"}},{"text":"자신이","meaning":"自信","explanation":"자신：自信；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자신","audio":"/audio/5239d0a84de6c1ea2bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71197","senseId":"1","lemma":"자신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자신이","audio":"/audio/6a54dbc4bc9e97b835b6.mp3"}},{"text":"없는데.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는데","audio":"/audio/060fd9365a8fa1c09d4d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"5239d0a84de6c1ea","term":"자신","zh":"自信","audio":"/audio/5239d0a84de6c1ea2bb6.mp3","entryId":"71197","definition":"自己坚信可以做成某事或某事一定会那样发展；或指该信念。","pronunciation":["자신"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e7864ea082880f5bb6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.205,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16121","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7571,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这家公司要用英语进行面试呢。","怎么办？我对英语可没自信啊。","适合搭配鱼类的饮料，有什么好推荐的吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这家公司要用英语进行面试呢。","怎么办？我对英语可没自信啊。","适合搭配鱼类的饮料，有什么好推荐的吗？"],"answer":1}]}
